- Use Doxygen-style documentation for all public APIs, non-obvious code, and new features.
- Require architectural documentation for new modules and major infrastructure changes.
- Document all new features and infrastructure changes in code and in docs/.
- Avoid obvious or redundant comments; focus on useful docs for IntelliSense and maintainers.
- Keep documentation up to date with code changes.
- Provide module-level and file-level overviews where appropriate.

